{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_02ebf19d5e146f12eb7238bfc87736620d0974a08f7f894a7826969b0fbbe990","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"agent-field/swe-af@311f376a2f12 snapshot 3876c9a6cfec396b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_123c0b5484d9a4134aedcb90d62898eb0200ae77d36312ccb165d368c0cecbc7","slc_154935d5829a2faf01b4ef7591c39e9a167a81e40a43ec83ad883b1575cf19fe","slc_2bd10bae9ac5a45435880f2b80c26fed83c107c7bee487e9dfb551fd09bfdddb","slc_c6019642f9da51711d0dd0f4b6708a154fc8333d414564f5f958d791a9f5e506"],"source_ids":["src_147f9ac28c835f33b59d862016901cbf"],"text":"Web search is opt-in for the open runtime: setting OPENCODE_ENABLE_EXA=1 and EXA_API_KEY exposes opencode's websearch/webfetch tools to reasoners, with a restraint guideline appended to the coder's system prompt.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_19c2136da4b1cdaabb4b5ded8c0fba28e27fb12024c7540bbdcc632c101e87d7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"agent-field/swe-af@311f376a2f12 snapshot 3876c9a6cfec396b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8e06633234b5714332f066390d496bad39b57d7ff418192c40e6960ecee8a85e","slc_94a187a39e3fbe580cae1778c12a216b885c31635b548ccf51b934de856d422d","slc_b4c77be5e8729b1afdf8a3f296e61ab96ba5133eb7426bfdaadd667f03fcdcb5"],"source_ids":["src_147f9ac28c835f33b59d862016901cbf"],"text":"Three nested control loops adapt to difficulty: coder retries on QA/review failure, an issue advisor retries/splits/accepts with debt, and a replanner restructures the remaining DAG on escalated failures.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1a668e271c5add279af2f48e0ea4f672036e3a5e9459022f2714f94e722b0f8f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"agent-field/swe-af@311f376a2f12 snapshot 3876c9a6cfec396b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_303982d6e262899d54bc07201ee7cd18a558093b068f98ba3942b6aab790e582","slc_4e4540bba8f0d028ff7f1e8b8f00fb17b4ca3c9ea64cdcd698a277b8091e1b1f"],"source_ids":["src_147f9ac28c835f33b59d862016901cbf"],"text":"Multi-repo builds pass config.repos as an array where each repo has a role: primary (failures block) or dependency (failures captured but non-blocking).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_54e6e494f81ce807e81a4826e1f0b5918770143fe869871e68f6d4826bab8640","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"agent-field/swe-af@311f376a2f12 snapshot 3876c9a6cfec396b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6562bc49ac3387487aedf053dce1e9824a24ce15886733ffa4d8927cc8507c0d"],"source_ids":["src_147f9ac28c835f33b59d862016901cbf"],"text":"The Claude runtime's first-party WebSearch/WebFetch is not wired in; web search works only on the open (opencode) runtime.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5a15e494dc1550e43b7789c4ac9f6e342fee2309cdb28cd07de6253a8dcccd1a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"agent-field/swe-af@311f376a2f12 snapshot 3876c9a6cfec396b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2974eee7236f49bb42a0500f749f9ac8848dea08f8d29e3549b44d5290c2380c","slc_8f490ba5a389afcaf546c0c3561d495b6c8e4505a4a5658ab9082f3d9bf400ed","slc_b4557e35a75c1d85cddc222f1d85cd84e00235e5a83cbc440390c8543fb2d882"],"source_ids":["src_147f9ac28c835f33b59d862016901cbf"],"text":"Builds are triggered through the af CLI (af >= 0.1.87) via `af call swe-planner.build --in ...`, or by POSTing to the AgentField HTTP endpoint /api/v1/execute/async/swe-planner.build.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6d4c517fccd3534f6e655998d55c72368ab1386ef9ca80af806634dfe581def7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"agent-field/swe-af@311f376a2f12 snapshot 3876c9a6cfec396b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3d23dd2d6719dd98aabffe074ae8d26e3d6ef6b24be439c72920576bf852e3f4"],"source_ids":["src_147f9ac28c835f33b59d862016901cbf"],"text":"ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL is process-wide, so a single deployment cannot route Claude and MiniMax Anthropic-compatible traffic to different endpoints.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6ee0275603cdfa3373cbff18e23f542ff7cf503efa7a4e6153fac2ea4ca44182","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"agent-field/swe-af@311f376a2f12 snapshot 3876c9a6cfec396b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5d55137b09974ab3a598cd9d1b187f820ad18bbb23a561df893d8af878b87740"],"source_ids":["src_147f9ac28c835f33b59d862016901cbf"],"text":"Entry points register with the control plane carrying an entrypoint tag and routing description, discoverable via af ls --entrypoints or GET /api/v1/discovery/capabilities on agentfield >= 0.1.113.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_72867db9eb66dfa5f3b70a3f62a1df832118bb7e345a6a5f8caf55fae46c1b1f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"agent-field/swe-af@311f376a2f12 snapshot 3876c9a6cfec396b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_30c182621dbc68330b9093ceda4667989c916498bdaefee640304392cf29b280"],"source_ids":["src_147f9ac28c835f33b59d862016901cbf"],"text":"Three runtimes are supported via a flat config map: claude_code (Claude), open_code (OpenCode with OpenRouter/OpenAI/Google/Anthropic IDs), and codex (OpenAI Codex CLI).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_810fc6edb526b6513c0f756926e61190287412ac420255517b3e929cdab5bdba","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"agent-field/swe-af@311f376a2f12 snapshot 3876c9a6cfec396b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_141e00b7cbbba6e37013283267616ed2f19e19c884e5416fa07c41d3de537a78","slc_5d4b5403d29c79660babb06e0dfe11df78125a8e7b10d3f67ada5bf59ca3e9db","slc_888b58fefc4c88463810cf289838cc882bb1ce9bfeff0e577a69e65295abbaa5","slc_d66cfc9724dac719ce8b5f71f2b10f6f3a77f1a49c31f674c0331708024668db"],"source_ids":["src_147f9ac28c835f33b59d862016901cbf"],"text":"A self-reported benchmark scores SWE-AF 95/100 with haiku (~$20) and MiniMax M2.5 (~$6) versus Claude Code sonnet (73), Codex o3 (62), and Claude Code haiku (59) on a Node.js todo-app prompt, using a five-dimension scoring framework.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8e29e0cb3fb655a071817e723834b97830dbf4dda5cc03a47bb368a776899408","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"agent-field/swe-af@311f376a2f12 snapshot 3876c9a6cfec396b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3a103454a13a204c204c3aedd48b9dc5763abfecb0e83d3151db6b47ce79445e"],"source_ids":["src_147f9ac28c835f33b59d862016901cbf"],"text":"Repository development practice: the README's Tests badge points to a make check command run via GitHub Actions CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a744c784aabe7959650a82e5309f1963bb5ab19a31b7d7301a3cc1399fea1758","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"agent-field/swe-af@311f376a2f12 snapshot 3876c9a6cfec396b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3c623602c456dc9b0b58567b13e090bd0857cd87b10493cb94d3bec7be4fea18","slc_682dc27a1a2b7b56387bf0ae98bff3cbec6194d7e8a8cb49ed574a50a8ed876f"],"source_ids":["src_147f9ac28c835f33b59d862016901cbf"],"text":"With only an OpenRouter or Infron key set and no SWE_DEFAULT_RUNTIME, the system auto-selects the open_code runtime and defaults roles to a deepseek model id.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b721df68cc56ba5aa86e4b8a2008a09e7ee7bd608fd1b0768ef2d4247c3cf16d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"agent-field/swe-af@311f376a2f12 snapshot 3876c9a6cfec396b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_38919f51781e2e4ac1c21095073a3caeb59c6737e61cb0f0ac95e00ac55fce46","slc_706d5fd7b37ea1ea736fe8fbbd5ca5ec8467b7ca3f5fe63b5364d7306b0f30b0"],"source_ids":["src_147f9ac28c835f33b59d862016901cbf"],"text":"Input accepts repo_url for remote repos or repo_path for local workspaces, plus a config map with runtime, per-role models, and enable_learning.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c0c2403bb545078012dc55a89a8a74a39c85bd011e780a33cf311354fd0007e5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"agent-field/swe-af@311f376a2f12 snapshot 3876c9a6cfec396b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3dfc49085ac3624c07db00829209a9a1005bcefd2b23f9cfad91c15616538fa9","slc_a0b2eebf073bd56a9c5e0c48f4a648583744d1bcd14981be187cccfc94447b64","slc_a9234424812f6b3cf7dc6fc24f9e53ee5969442946b30de12727620ccddfc09f","slc_e1fbf8e024674e5228e177cd5fb6c64c7898632f70b7ac16294a0daffb005c20"],"source_ids":["src_147f9ac28c835f33b59d862016901cbf"],"text":"An issue-level entry point swe-planner.implement_issue (and swe-fast.implement_issue) skips planning agents, runs a coder-reviewer loop on an isolated branch, and returns the branch name as the deliverable.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c88adf230f94d1830a7e147620fc5fcaf1a4ceaa0df9a77f9750cf00f81e22cb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"agent-field/swe-af@311f376a2f12 snapshot 3876c9a6cfec396b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_49dbe7da820d12ad9bef498fe9470cb147e80d71dc26fccdb75f1d9116581a7f","slc_d132ff314a33f47fc379f32779e4058eecf7295f7b982574bda4835cd403a5be"],"source_ids":["src_147f9ac28c835f33b59d862016901cbf"],"text":"After opening a PR, a post-PR CI gate watches GitHub Actions and runs a bounded fix-and-repush loop (default max_ci_fix_cycles=2) whose agent is forbidden from silencing tests; unresolved failures leave the PR open for human review.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f182ba75c9b9b63e44b09d78f9d6061e8adf2dfe2f970f694bcbbb9e33ca2522","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"agent-field/swe-af@311f376a2f12 snapshot 3876c9a6cfec396b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3588f11cd80ced97f5e0886b1ca56004c6808889fc7cd906bfb5b8bb0293db51","slc_8675e4fab9b10f3723de1d8feea59481aecdc6536397a2845bdf1e3f776ae7fb"],"source_ids":["src_147f9ac28c835f33b59d862016901cbf"],"text":"Issues are dependency-sorted and executed in parallel across isolated git worktrees; a typical run reportedly spins up 400-500+ agent instances, scaling to thousands for larger DAGs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f3462955576b931bd0217aa053cab42bdef9e60cfd33a3c6f25e10da1a1f72b6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"agent-field/swe-af@311f376a2f12 snapshot 3876c9a6cfec396b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e5ea3ae123c0eabafecc5bc25bcb2fd07213ab7e08cdb228b672c34f569f28e4"],"source_ids":["src_147f9ac28c835f33b59d862016901cbf"],"text":"Local requirements are Python 3.12+, the AgentField control plane (af), and an AI provider API key (Anthropic, OpenRouter, OpenAI, or Google).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:30:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55407c033b1a4987a589a45115470123"}
